  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Inconsistencies between the proposed floor plans, elevations, and site plans prevent a full and accurate assessment of the design and scale of the extensions and their impact on neighbouring amenity, in accordance with the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CS1 of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013), and the London Borough of Harrow Residential Design Guide Supplementary Planning Document (2010).",
    "Insufficient information, namely a parking survey and specific details regarding onsite car parking provision, has been provided in support of the application to demonstrate that the proposal would not exacerbate on-street car parking stress or adversely affect highway safety in the locality, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework, Policies T1 and T2 of the London Plan (2021) and Policies DM26 and DM44C of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013)."
  ],
